{
    "word": "fomentation",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "b5bc044a-5ea8-39f3-a74a-bedc95a7b612",
                "word": "fomentation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "988d60bc-a21b-456d-ae00-462fcc20870c",
                        "entry_id": "b5bc044a-5ea8-39f3-a74a-bedc95a7b612",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "fomentations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "57e51a26-7d3d-3477-9f34-3e17d036d012",
                        "entry_id": "b5bc044a-5ea8-39f3-a74a-bedc95a7b612",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of fomenting; the application of warm, soft, medicinal substances, as for the purpose of easing pain by relaxing the skin, or of discussing (dispersing) tumours."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b9ec814-f224-4f6c-b7ff-7773030ed63d",
                                "sense_id": "57e51a26-7d3d-3477-9f34-3e17d036d012",
                                "text": "Twenty leeches were ordered to be applied round the nose every two days; frequent emollient fomentations; the local vapour bath; general bathing; stimulating pedilavia; a strict regimen; vegetables, milk, white meats; demulcent or acidulated drinks; avoidance of exposure to the sun or to cold air; flannel waistcoat and trousers. This treatment, being strictly observed for two months, caused all the inflammatory symptoms to disappear, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc6cff84-7af0-447b-8d37-2db998deb1fa",
                                "sense_id": "57e51a26-7d3d-3477-9f34-3e17d036d012",
                                "text": "We have already spoken of the great utility of hot fomentation to the stomach and bowels, as a means of relieving intense suffering in any internal organ of the body, or in the extremities."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b267486-7b89-4bce-b403-46b466a0efca",
                                "sense_id": "57e51a26-7d3d-3477-9f34-3e17d036d012",
                                "text": "Keeping bhūjra patra or banana leaf above the fourfold cloth is essential. Apart from their attributes to help in this chemical process, they prevent the fall of mercury from the paste through the cloth into the bottom of the pot of dolā yantra. If during fomentation mercury penetrates through the layer of paste then it will remain above the layer of leaf placed over the cloth, thus permitting the intended chemical action to continue."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4a4d6196-b3ae-3659-baf2-79635a7fcc95",
                        "entry_id": "b5bc044a-5ea8-39f3-a74a-bedc95a7b612",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A lotion or poultice applied to a diseased or injured part of the body."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "af249381-9111-4d13-9a81-af32753791bd",
                                "sense_id": "4a4d6196-b3ae-3659-baf2-79635a7fcc95",
                                "text": "[…] I purged him with our Quintaeſſencia Solutiuo, eight dayes together, that being done I made him a fomentation, that cauſed him to ſweate well, and to ſpitte aboundaunce, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef7f6bde-573b-4a8b-9212-f9213674acd9",
                                "sense_id": "4a4d6196-b3ae-3659-baf2-79635a7fcc95",
                                "text": "If too much milke be the cauſe, then the Nurſe ſhall not give the childe ſucke ſo often, nor in ſuch plenty: If it proceed from wind, and that doe cauſe the childe to be thus troubled, it ſhall be diſcuſſed with Fomentations applied to the belly and navell; and with Carminative Cliſters, which ſhall bee given him, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ac53db9-b21e-4bb7-a23d-2ea8272c2c23",
                                "sense_id": "4a4d6196-b3ae-3659-baf2-79635a7fcc95",
                                "text": "I then applied a Fomentation to the Part, which highly anſwered the Intention; and after three or four Times dreſſing, the Wound began to diſcharge a thick Pus or Matter, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "20293acb-ee38-44e5-a70c-eb55ec51df5c",
                                "sense_id": "4a4d6196-b3ae-3659-baf2-79635a7fcc95",
                                "text": "The abscess may be hastened to a head by hot fomentations or poultices. It is then ready to be opened and drained."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b7bb8930-e134-377f-b35d-b2d33bbce813",
                        "entry_id": "b5bc044a-5ea8-39f3-a74a-bedc95a7b612",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Encouragement; excitation; instigation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0feaa707-4111-4363-8e18-d061002a5520",
                                "sense_id": "b7bb8930-e134-377f-b35d-b2d33bbce813",
                                "text": "[T]he Catholick King complained very much thereof, upbraiding the moſt Chriſtian King how ill this did correſpond to the ſo many aſſiſtances which were given by Spain to France ſince that from thence ſo great a fomentation was now preparing to his Rebels in Flanders."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32e697be-f142-43e0-bb75-741580d29465",
                                "sense_id": "b7bb8930-e134-377f-b35d-b2d33bbce813",
                                "text": "[I]n remote situations, physical and moral phenomena being divested of adventitious attractions, and presented to the mind in their true colours and real relations, are likely to attract its energies in proportion to their importance: at least, in this medium, many objects almost invisible in a more luminous and diversified scene, are seen so large, as compleatly to conceal some of these which with a little fomentation excite the most ardent popular attention— […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4348da04-3dc9-4166-8e0c-cd5a0d64119d",
                                "sense_id": "b7bb8930-e134-377f-b35d-b2d33bbce813",
                                "text": "In the popular imagination, and not only there, the progressive and beneficial side of the oil industry […] has been tied in inextricably with a darker side which has featured massive corruption, the fomentation of political upheavals within particular countries and the concentration of power on an international scale in a way which has led to large-scale but unpredictable shifts in the structure of the world oil system."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cb34bbc1-83c5-4628-b45a-eae9f48f1a9f",
                        "source_entry_id": "b5bc044a-5ea8-39f3-a74a-bedc95a7b612",
                        "source_sense_description": "the act of fomenting",
                        "target_lang_word": "fomentation",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fomentation",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "73922839-f424-3f8f-9eb1-70981804f186",
                                        "entry_id": "c314b978-e2ea-3e7f-8e9f-4baca3ae6f28",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Application d’un épithème, par exemple à l’aide d’une compresse, sur une partie du corps."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c857607-5f0b-4fdb-832d-8bdc28bcedc3",
                                                "sense_id": "73922839-f424-3f8f-9eb1-70981804f186",
                                                "text": "On doit aussi s’abstenir des injections, […], & de l’usage des vins aromatiques & des fomentations : elles ne font que prolonger les cures : …. (« L’agronome ou dictionnaire portatif du cultivateur. » -Rouen, 1787)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c83ee0f1-17e1-4fa7-a6a4-3dc7e22379ea",
                                                "sense_id": "73922839-f424-3f8f-9eb1-70981804f186",
                                                "text": "Ce n’était point une linition douce, une fomentation onctueuse, mais un massage vigoureux, pratiqué à bras raccourcis, et qui rappelait plutôt les éraillures de l’étrille que les caresses de la main."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b973cc74-4cad-3721-bb28-11ebb308eaf4",
                                        "entry_id": "c314b978-e2ea-3e7f-8e9f-4baca3ae6f28",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de préparer et d’entretenir un mouvement d’indiscipline, de révolte."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44b11307-2fd0-4f0f-ab2d-9fef0ff72f72",
                                                "sense_id": "b973cc74-4cad-3721-bb28-11ebb308eaf4",
                                                "text": "La constante sollicitude du Roi, cette rêverie altérante dont il est consumé et dont nous montrâmes si souvent déjà la fomentation, l’entraînèrent à surenchérir."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "546b739f-db29-4c44-babc-0716d394fa31",
                                                "sense_id": "b973cc74-4cad-3721-bb28-11ebb308eaf4",
                                                "text": "La fomentation d’une crise."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "02a20744-8f28-4446-a93f-bc3067cbdee7",
                        "source_entry_id": "b5bc044a-5ea8-39f3-a74a-bedc95a7b612",
                        "source_sense_description": "the act of fomenting",
                        "target_lang_word": "припа́рка",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "припа́рка",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad503447-5b1b-3485-ad2c-ef7160333b29",
                                        "entry_id": "bb7c38a4-8553-3986-8051-23aaa0156d05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "повязка, смоченная в горячей воде или лекарственном растворе и прикладываемая к больному месту; компресс"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e46a50ca-47fd-434f-8753-2b6404c42003",
                                                "sense_id": "ad503447-5b1b-3485-ad2c-ef7160333b29",
                                                "text": "Комната эта назначалась, собственно, для нагревания воды и для изготовления припарок; с этой целью имелась в ней большая плита, на которой стояли медные чайники и кастрюли с льняным семенем; над плитой висели тряпки."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "000d00aa-734e-4d99-8d89-e109a909434e",
                                                "sense_id": "ad503447-5b1b-3485-ad2c-ef7160333b29",
                                                "text": "Прикладывал старичок сенную припарку на голову дня три, и полегчало."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab623943-e18a-3d11-828e-fae088c0c85b",
                                        "entry_id": "bb7c38a4-8553-3986-8051-23aaa0156d05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "лечебная процедура, состоящая в прикладывании к больному месту такой повязки"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f50ba2b-59c4-4b9f-bb7b-755139658032",
                                                "sense_id": "ab623943-e18a-3d11-828e-fae088c0c85b",
                                                "text": "Половину следующего дня она была тиха, молчалива и послушна, как ни мучил её наш лекарь припарками и микстурой."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f07b128-f196-4085-aaca-e3f4467afec1",
                                                "sense_id": "ab623943-e18a-3d11-828e-fae088c0c85b",
                                                "text": "В целях устранения морщин некоторые прибегают к горячим припаркам, паровым ваннам и в особенности к массажу, последний часто дает весьма значительные результаты."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6eddbc4e-50d7-3559-93ae-0afd2990bf27",
                                        "entry_id": "bb7c38a4-8553-3986-8051-23aaa0156d05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "перен., прост. порка"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd26bfed-59c0-41c6-b2ab-c27fea4373e9",
                                                "sense_id": "6eddbc4e-50d7-3559-93ae-0afd2990bf27",
                                                "text": "Впрочем, это наставление было вовсе излишне, потому что ректор и профессоры-монахи не жалели лоз и плетей, и часто ликторы по их приказанию пороли своих консулов так жестоко, что те несколько недель почёсывали свои шаровары. Многим из них это было вовсе ничего и казалось немного чем крепче хорошей водки с перцем; другим, наконец, сильно надоедали такие беспрестанные припарки, и они бежали на Запорожье, если умели найти дорогу и если сами не были перехватываемы на пути."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
